{"4535800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ravens Imaginary Friends", "steam_appid": 4535800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5085290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving an accident where she nearly lost her life, Raven wakes up to a life changing surprise. Her imaginary friends from when she was little, Robin and Venus, have appeared in the real world! She is in shock because not only have they both grown up to become beautiful women, but they also confess that they have both fallen in love with her and have been fighting deep inside of her subconscious for years because of that. Now it's up to Raven to handle recovering from this accident, getting back to work, maintaining her relationships with her friends and family and making a tough choice to fix this complicated love triangle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 main routes, one for Robin and one for Venus, along with a secret 3rd route. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced characters and beautiful art, a 100% human made experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of Yuri and girl kissing! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535800/extras/34ba768de509133f56e1d4baeec04d99.avif?t=1786563442\" alt=\"Raven. Age = 24. Personality = relaxed. Likes video games, adding to her collections. Dislikes wearing flashy clothes. Coasts through life and survives on vibes; things just seem to work out for her because she&#039;s friendly, attractive, and has a good support system around her. She has been struggling with her sexuality and is a closeted lesbian. Works as a host in a restaurant. \" width=1492 height=1138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535800/extras/e9be671622072bea40b418b8616fd82a.avif?t=1786563442\" alt=\"Venus. Age = 24. Personality = Outgoing. Likes fashion, makeup, fun conversations. Dislikes people being mad at her. Is a playful and expressive person who follows her passions no matter where they may take her, even if it leads to trouble. Can come off as a self-centered and superficial person but cares much more about the people around her than you would expect.\" width=1492 height=1138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535800/extras/19599687af46393dcdb973761ef68617.avif?t=1786563442\" alt=\"Robin. Age = 24. Personality = Ambitious. Likes exercising, cuteness, learning new things. Dislikes being made fun of. A very wholesome person who wants to learn more about the world around her so that she can develop her own unique interests and personality. Has a hard time conveying her feelings but is working on growing confident and expressing herself better. \" width=1492 height=1138 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving an accident where she nearly lost her life, Raven wakes up to a life changing surprise. Her imaginary friends from when she was little, Robin and Venus, have appeared in the real world! She is in shock because not only have they both grown up to become beautiful women, but they also confess that they have both fallen in love with her and have been fighting deep inside of her subconscious for years because of that. Now it's up to Raven to handle recovering from this accident, getting back to work, maintaining her relationships with her friends and family and making a tough choice to fix this complicated love triangle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 main routes, one for Robin and one for Venus, along with a secret 3rd route. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced characters and beautiful art, a 100% human made experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of Yuri and girl kissing! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535800/extras/34ba768de509133f56e1d4baeec04d99.avif?t=1786563442\" alt=\"Raven. Age = 24. Personality = relaxed. Likes video games, adding to her collections. Dislikes wearing flashy clothes. Coasts through life and survives on vibes; things just seem to work out for her because she&#039;s friendly, attractive, and has a good support system around her. She has been struggling with her sexuality and is a closeted lesbian. Works as a host in a restaurant. \" width=1492 height=1138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535800/extras/e9be671622072bea40b418b8616fd82a.avif?t=1786563442\" alt=\"Venus. Age = 24. Personality = Outgoing. Likes fashion, makeup, fun conversations. Dislikes people being mad at her. Is a playful and expressive person who follows her passions no matter where they may take her, even if it leads to trouble. Can come off as a self-centered and superficial person but cares much more about the people around her than you would expect.\" width=1492 height=1138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535800/extras/19599687af46393dcdb973761ef68617.avif?t=1786563442\" alt=\"Robin. Age = 24. Personality = Ambitious. Likes exercising, cuteness, learning new things. Dislikes being made fun of. A very wholesome person who wants to learn more about the world around her so that she can develop her own unique interests and personality. Has a hard time conveying her feelings but is working on growing confident and expressing herself better. \" width=1492 height=1138 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A Yuri Visual Novel about a girl named Raven who wakes up after an accident to a life changing surprise. Her imaginary friends from when she was little have appeared in the real world and are deeply in love with her! Now she has to make a tough choice to fix this complicated love triangle.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535800/039e7af6aa39bee81b816e4e35d494b33ba4fc62/header.jpg?t=1786563442", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535800/371710ab5896f87e4964c48f33edf47e3b3e148c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786563442", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535800/371710ab5896f87e4964c48f33edf47e3b3e148c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786563442", "website": "https://wacolstudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4th generation Intel Core processor or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10(64bit) / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6th generation Intel Core processor or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></